{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日から始まりました\n「33色のラブストーリー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうかけた人もいるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと電話ができちゃうってやつです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/04/3720627/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーそれぞれ色があるんだけど\n中田はインディゴ色の女の子ってことで\n新入社員の子という設定のストーリーを\nやらせてもらったよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんには\n引き込まれますねって言ってもらったよ←え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0570-0246-18"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にかけると\n中田と電話してる感じになります＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通話料金はかかっちゃうんだけど\n頑張ってみたので良かったら聞いてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、携帯以外からはかからないので\n気をつけて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は友達編"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/04/3720627/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週、再来週は\n告白編と恋人編になるので\n友達編を聴いたかたはちょっと待ってて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新されたらまたここに書くね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の乃木坂は\nメールも電話もできちゃうね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"710年平城京遷都は\nどんな語呂あわせで覚えた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n『なんと大きな』と『納豆ねばねば』だったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メの道教えた話の写メ\n前髪もちょっと巻いてる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nうん！よく見てるね＼^^／\nふわふわ前髪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/04/3720627/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/04/3720627/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと見えるかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けっこう前に買ったんだけど\nこれはイヤークリップ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/04/3720627/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は『季刊 乃木坂』発売日だよ〜＼^^／\nよろしく〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/04/3720627/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}